{"game": "space-marine-2011", "language": "english", "appid": 55150, "month": "2019-01", "window": 3, "start_date": 1547596800, "end_date": 1548287999, "month_true_total": 76, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-09 17:56:27 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "48509030", "author": {"steamid": "76561198025734613", "personaname": "Raminez", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/raminez/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 1233, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 592, "last_played": 1673695844, "avatar": "f013b976da3e5744e5e106ea237837688ca38cb6"}, "language": "english", "review": "I received this game from Humble bundle.\nSingleplayer:\n- Story: Average (successfully tipped plot twist, so its not good at all)\n- Gameplay: Above average (fells good with sword/axe/hammer)\n- Graphics: Above average (low detail of weapons, quite shame)\n- AI: Average (sometimes just stuck in barrier)\n= Sum up: 7.0/10 (Game is not dynamic (needs to make enemies weaker and spawn them more) and that is crucial mistake. Whole game design is just send horde against player, quite boring after while, but still playable.)\nMultiplayer:\n- Progression/customisation: Perfect (there is just everything!)\n- Gameplay/AI: Same as singleplayer part\n= Sum up: 7/10 (Repetitive, sometimes boring.)\n\nIN TOTAL: 7/10 (Between average and good)", "timestamp_created": 1548266305, "timestamp_updated": 1673113676, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.504873931407928467", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": true, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "48499440", "author": {"steamid": "76561198005658624", "personaname": "Polsicaspian", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198005658624/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 362, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 362, "last_played": 1548220548, "avatar": "79d3fe5839617eb83a9661071ed021dd56ac8a5b"}, "language": "english", "review": "I would only recommend this game if you can get it for free, which was my case.\n\nWhat if Kratos had a gun? This is what this game feels like. It is fun and entertaining for a while, but it does get repetitive at some point and by the end I was actually wishing for it to be over, the combat felt a little boring, since meleeing the enemies got too complicated so it boiled down to your everyday shooter. That said I enjoyed the game.", "timestamp_created": 1548220848, "timestamp_updated": 1548220848, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": true, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "48487969", "author": {"steamid": "76561197991822415", "personaname": "Lametta", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/lamettaa/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 251, "playtime_forever": 284, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 180, "last_played": 1540828238, "avatar": "473acec3d0f9edfc9d30a70a26a197195a918f59"}, "language": "english", "review": "Nice Hack'n slash to pass the time. Don't expect somethng outstanding.\nIt does it's job though. (Kinda a 70% title)\nPlayed and finished it outside of steam.", "timestamp_created": 1548163816, "timestamp_updated": 1548163816, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 9, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.557958841323852539", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reaction